MewStage vendor patch text/0003 (third_party/NOTICE): FontResources.Register keeps every face of a family. The
registry kept one file per family name (the last registered), so a family registered from several files (Lora
Regular, Italic, Bold, Bold Italic) drew every weight and style with that one face on a standard MewUI platform host
(Kit mode). Each face is now kept with the weight and style its file declares (OS/2, else head), the FreeType path
picks the face CSS font matching would, and the DirectWrite / GDI / Direct2D paths load every file of the family so
their own matching chooses among them.

